        "subject": "Wazuh Alert — Suspicious IP Detected",
        "html": "=<p><b>AI Triage Summary:</b> {{ $json.content[0].text }}</p>\n<h2>Wazuh Security Alert</h2>\n<p><b>Source IP:</b> {{ $('Code in JavaScript').item.json.srcip }}</p>\n<p><b>Rule:</b> {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.title }}</p>\n<p><b>MITRE Technique:</b> {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.all_fields.rule.mitre.id[0] }}</p>\n<p><b>Tactic:</b> {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.all_fields.rule.mitre.tactic[0] }}</p>\n<hr>\n<h3>AbuseIPDB</h3>\n<p><b>Abuse Score:</b> {{ $('HTTP Request').item.json.data.abuseConfidenceScore }}</p>\n<p><b>ISP:</b> {{ $('HTTP Request').item.json.data.isp }}</p>\n<p><b>Is Tor:</b> {{ $('HTTP Request').item.json.data.isTor }}</p>\n<p><b>Total Reports:</b> {{ $('HTTP Request').item.json.data.totalReports }}</p>",
